<title>POLAND: BPH Q1 net falls to PLN 74.5 mln.</title>
<headline>BPH Q1 net falls to PLN 74.5 mln.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-05-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>BPH preliminary results for the first quarter of the year ending March 31, 1997</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>						Q1 1997     Q1 1996</p>
<p>    operating profit		     105.37  vs  124.22</p>
<p>    pre-tax profit			 105.37  vs  105.37</p>
<p>    net profit				74.51  vs   82.17</p>
<p>NOTE - Full company name is Bank Przemyslowo-Handlowy SA.</p>
<p>    revenues from securities		na   vs     na</p>
<p>    interest and similar revenues    289.49  vs  256.16</p>
<p>    interest and similar costs	 146.69  vs  130.57</p>
<p>@</p>
<p>    revenues from commission	    37.16  vs   24.26</p>
<p>    costs of commission		    3.04  vs    1.96</p>
<p>    income tax				30.86  vs   42.06</p>
<p>    other taxes				 na   vs     na</p>
<p>    extraordinary profit		   0.00  vs    0.00</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
